  "description": "***Please reply to this add via email only*** \nNewly Renovated 2-Bedroom Apartment for Rent in Clonmacken Court, Limerick\nPresented by Anthony McGann, Keller Williams Ireland\nCVs submitted via HomeHak are warmly welcomed\n\nAnthony McGann of Keller Williams Ireland is delighted to present this beautifully refurbished, ground-floor, dual-aspect two-bedroom apartment to the lettings market. Located in the well-maintained and secure gated development of Clonmacken Court (comprising just 28 units), this property combines space, style, and convenience in one of Limerick’s most sought-after residential areas.\n\nProperty Features:\n\nSpacious two-bedroom, ground-floor apartment\n\nRecently renovated throughout to a high standard\n\nDual-aspect layout offering excellent natural light\n\nApprox. 74 sq.m of modern living space\n\nEntrance hall, large open-plan kitchen/living/dining area\n\nTwo generous double bedrooms (main with en-suite)\n\nMain bathroom with contemporary finishes\n\nEnergy-efficient A1-rated storage heaters\n\nDouble-glazed windows for enhanced insulation\n\nBER Rating: C3\n\nAll new appliances included\n\nSecure, gated development with a strong sense of community\n\nViewings strictly by appointment only\n\nCVs submitted via HomeHak are warmly welcomed\n\nSuperb Location:\nClonmacken Court offers unrivalled access to key amenities:\n\nJetland Shopping Centre – within walking distance\n\nTUS Gaelic Grounds & Thomond Park – a short stroll away\n\nNa Piarsaigh GAA Club, local gyms, cafes, restaurants, and hotels – all nearby\n\nExcellent local schools and sporting facilities in the vicinity\n\nEasy access to all major road networks around Limerick\n\nDistances:\n\nLimerick City Centre: Approx. 3 km (5–10 minutes by car)\n\nShannon Town Centre: Approx. 22 km (20–25 minutes by car)\n\nThis apartment offers the ideal combination of location, modern comfort, and convenience. An excellent opportunity to secure a high-quality home in a prime Limerick location.\n\nImportant Notice:\nKeller Williams Ireland has taken every care to ensure the accuracy of this information but does not guarantee its completeness. All prospective tenants are encouraged to verify details independently. Keller Williams Ireland will not be held liable for any discrepancies or changes.",
